(7622517, 1234785, 81362, '<td valign="top">Abstract but without sense of scale. The uniformity of parts of the red diagonal area despite a calibrated monitor suggests the red channel may have clipped at the bright end (easy to do even when overall exposure is good).</td>', 'Abstract but without sense of scale. The uniformity of parts of the red diagonal area despite a calibrated monitor suggests the red channel may have clipped at the bright end (easy to do even when overall exposure is good).', '2019-03-29 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
