elf could create anything anywhere as wonderful . i can see now that you have very kindly put shared your technique ...even after reading it .. i feel it would be beyond my capabilities .. and please ramble on .. it makes me feel a lot better for doing the same .. !! .. ;)   Thanks so much, Roz. Let''s ramble any time we feel like it (Hugs).', '2019-04-01 02:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
